@startuml
title Use Case SIPRAJA — As-Built 27 Oktober 2026
left to right direction
actor Pelapor
actor Admin
actor "Super Admin" as SuperAdmin
actor "API e-Profil" as Eprofil
actor "Bot WhatsApp" as WA
actor "Google Gemini" as Gemini
actor "Survei SKM" as SKM
rectangle SIPRAJA {
  usecase "Verifikasi WhatsApp / OTP" as OTP
  usecase "Membuat laporan\n(tanpa NIK)" as Report
  usecase "Panduan / draf Asisten AI" as AI
  usecase "Melihat status sendiri\n(token browser)" as Status
  usecase "Penilaian laporan selesai" as Feedback
  usecase "Membuka survei SKM" as Survey
  usecase "Pilih tahun data" as Year
  usecase "Baca daftar/detail laporan" as Read
  usecase "Catat laporan kanal lain" as Create
  usecase "Tetapkan/ganti/kosongkan\nAdmin penanggung jawab" as Assign
  usecase "Proses / tolak / selesaikan / hapus\nlaporan penugasan sendiri" as Process
  usecase "Kegiatan internal + personel" as Activity
  usecase "Evaluasi kegiatan\n(eksternal: Admin penanggung jawab)" as Evaluate
  usecase "Ekspor kegiatan\nExcel / PDF / Word" as Export
  usecase "Arsip + baca feedback" as Archive
  usecase "Dashboard + peta persebaran" as Dashboard
  usecase "Kelola akun Admin" as Users
  usecase "Baca direktori pegawai e-Profil" as Employees
  usecase "Monitoring audit" as Audit
  usecase "Profil / pencarian / notifikasi" as Common
}
Pelapor -- OTP
Pelapor -- Report
Pelapor -- AI
Pelapor -- Status
Pelapor -- Feedback
Pelapor -- Survey
Report .> OTP : <<include>>
WA -- OTP
WA -- Report
WA -- Process
Gemini -- AI
SKM -- Survey
Admin -- Year
Admin -- Read
Admin -- Create
Admin -- Process
Admin -- Activity
Admin -- Evaluate
Admin -- Export
Admin -- Archive
Admin -- Common
SuperAdmin -- Year
SuperAdmin -- Read
SuperAdmin -- Assign
SuperAdmin -- Activity
SuperAdmin -- Export
SuperAdmin -- Dashboard
SuperAdmin -- Users
SuperAdmin -- Employees
SuperAdmin -- Audit
SuperAdmin -- Common
Eprofil -- Employees
Eprofil -- Activity
note bottom of Assign
  Super Admin assigns active Admin, without processing report status.
  Internal data follows selected year; user directory is global.
end note
@enduml
